{
  "systemInstruction": {
    "parts": [
      {
        "text": "You are a marketing team in one: a strategist, a copywriter, an SEO specialist, a social media manager and a brand consultant. You analyse a product image and produce a complete, ready-to-publish marketing package.\n\nRules:\n- Obey the brand voice exactly. Use the words in wordsToUse where they fit naturally; never use any word in wordsToAvoid.\n- Write for the stated target audience, in the stated language, at the stated caption length.\n- Match the funnel stage: TOFU educates and attracts, MOFU builds consideration, BOFU drives the decision, Retention deepens an existing relationship.\n- Never invent product facts that are not visible in the image or stated in the input. Describe what you can see; do not claim ingredients, certifications, prices or results you have not been given.\n- Return only the fields the schema defines. Populate an optional section only when its feature flag is true; omit the key entirely otherwise. Never emit a section filled with placeholder or empty values.\n- Set schemaVersion to 1. Set meta.generatedAt, meta.model and meta.durationMs to null."
      }
    ]
  },
  "contents": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [
        {
          "inline_data": {
            "mime_type": "{{4.headers.`content-type`}}",
            "data": "{{base64(4.data)}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Generate the marketing package for this image.\n\n== POST CONTEXT ==\ntitle: {{2.record.title}}\nexisting caption: {{2.record.caption}}\nplatforms: {{join(2.record.platforms; \", \")}}\n\n== MARKETING SETTINGS ==\ngoal: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.goal; \"brand_awareness\")}}\nfunnel stage: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.funnelStage; \"TOFU\")}}\ncaption length: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.captionLength; \"Medium\")}}\nlanguage: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.language; \"English\")}}\n\n== BRAND VOICE ==\nname: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.name}}\ndescription: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.description}}\nmission: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.mission}}\ntone: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.tone; \"Professional\")}}\nwriting style: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.writingStyle}}\npersonality: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.personality}}\ntarget audience: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.targetAudience}}\nemoji style: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.emojiStyle; \"Light\")}}\nCTA style: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.ctaStyle; \"Soft\")}}\nwords to use: {{join(2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.wordsToUse; \", \")}}\nwords to avoid: {{join(2.record.ai_studio_input.brandVoice.wordsToAvoid; \", \")}}\n\n== COMPETITOR ==\nbrand: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.competitor.brandName}}\nwebsite: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.competitor.website}}\nsocial: {{2.record.ai_studio_input.competitor.socialHandle}}\n\n== FEATURE FLAGS ==\nseo: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.features.seo; \"false\")}}\ncampaign: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.features.campaign; \"false\")}}\ncompetitorAnalysis: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.features.competitorAnalysis; \"false\")}}\nplatformVariations: {{ifempty(2.record.ai_studio_input.features.platformVariations; \"false\")}}\n\nHonour the feature flags strictly. A flag reading \"true\" means include that\nsection; anything else (false, or blank) means omit the key entirely:\n- seo -> \"seo\"\n- campaign -> \"campaign\"\n- competitorAnalysis -> \"competitor\"\n- platformVariations -> \"platformVariations\"\n\nAlways include: imageAnalysis, contentVariations, ctaOptions, hashtagGroups.\n\nUnder platformVariations, emit a key ONLY for the platforms listed above.\n\nFor contentVariations produce between 3 and 9 variations, each in a distinct tone drawn from the allowed tone values, each with a hook that works as a standalone opening line.\n\nFor hashtagGroups produce at least the trending, niche and branded groups. difficultyScore and popularityScore are your best estimates on a 0-100 scale. Emit tags without a leading \"#\".\n\nSet meta.status to \"complete\" and meta.produced to the exact list of section keys present in your response."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
